      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.491,
          "end": 4.89,
          "en": "[Maximilian] Now as mentioned in this section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.89,
          "end": 8.1,
          "en": "we'll build two demo projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 12.57,
          "en": "And here's the first demo project which we'll build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "An investment calculator where you can enter some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "about your planned investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 21.78,
          "en": "For example, your current savings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 24.69,
          "en": "the amount you're going to add every year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.69,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "the expected return on investment, your time horizon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 31.77,
          "en": "so the timeframe of this investment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.77,
          "end": 35.82,
          "en": "And then once you click calculate, you'll get a table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.82,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "with the results for this calculation where you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "year by year how much interest you're going to gain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 45.03,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 47.34,
          "en": "This is the first example application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.34,
          "end": 48.75,
          "en": "we're going to build here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.75,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "And for this application I created a starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 54.78,
          "en": "which you find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.78,
          "end": 57.99,
          "en": "Of course, you also find a code sandbox link attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 60.93,
          "en": "in case you wanna follow along there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.93,
          "end": 62.85,
          "en": "And in this starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 65.64,
          "en": "you'll find an image in the assets folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.64,
          "end": 69.12,
          "en": "and then some styles in the index CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 72.93,
          "en": "And then most importantly, you'll find an app.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.93,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "which includes some JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 80.19,
          "en": "and also some JSX code, but which doesn't work yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.19,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "This doesn't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 85.14,
          "en": "Instead in there I added some to-dos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.14,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "and some hints or comments regarding your tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 92.22,
          "en": "and what you might want to do with that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.22,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "And I'll provide you with more detailed tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 96.72,
          "en": "in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.72,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "But you can and should use this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 102.53999999999999,
          "en": "as a starting point because it also, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.53999999999999,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "contains some code you could use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 109.83,
          "en": "for calculating these investment results the interest gained",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.83,
          "end": 111.9,
          "en": "per year and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.9,
          "end": 114.39,
          "en": "I already created this code for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.39,
          "end": 116.75999999999999,
          "en": "so that you don't have to write it on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.75999999999999,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "and you don't have to come up with it on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 122.43,
          "en": "And I also essentially created all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.43,
          "end": 126.69,
          "en": "or almost all the JSX code you're going to need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.69,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "Though of course the data is missing in that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "It's not dynamic code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 135.3,
          "en": "Instead, it has some hard coded placeholders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.3,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "and it's of course not outputting any results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 142.17000000000002,
          "en": "We're also not managing any state yet in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.17000000000002,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "because that will all be things you should do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.62,
          "end": 147.63,
          "en": "And therefore, here are your tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.63,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "for this first demo project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 155.1,
          "en": "The first task is to take this one single app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.1,
          "end": 156.9,
          "en": "that you find in the starting code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.9,
          "end": 160.89,
          "en": "and you split it up into multiple smaller components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.89,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "It's up to you how granular you want to be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 168.18,
          "en": "and it's up to you to identify suitable components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.18,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "but you should at least be able to identify a few components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 175.713,
          "en": "you can split this one single component up into.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.7,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "So that will be the first task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 182.94,
          "en": "split the JSX code and the overall app component code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.94,
          "end": 185.22,
          "en": "into multiple components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.22,
          "end": 187.47,
          "en": "As a next step thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.47,
          "end": 190.35,
          "en": "I want you to handle some events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.35,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "To be precise I want you to handle the submit event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "when this form here is being submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 200.97,
          "en": "and I want you to handle the click event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.97,
          "end": 202.95,
          "en": "on that reset button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.95,
          "end": 205.74,
          "en": "You don't need to do anything yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.74,
          "end": 209.25,
          "en": "but you should add event handler functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.25,
          "end": 211.86,
          "en": "and make sure that some code gets triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.86,
          "end": 213.78,
          "en": "as the form is submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.78,
          "end": 216.123,
          "en": "or this reset button is being pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.2,
          "end": 220.38,
          "en": "But of course, handling events without doing anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.38,
          "end": 222.69,
          "en": "isn't too much fun.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.69,
          "end": 224.97,
          "en": "Therefore thereafter, as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.97,
          "end": 228.51,
          "en": "you should start managing some state, and it's of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.51,
          "end": 229.74,
          "en": "also your task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 232.5,
          "en": "to identify the different pieces of state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.5,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "you might want to manage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 237.45,
          "en": "Keep in mind that there are different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.45,
          "end": 240.9,
          "en": "of managing state, multiple state slices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.9,
          "end": 242.67,
          "en": "versus bigger objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.67,
          "end": 245.52,
          "en": "and it's totally up to you which approach you prefer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.52,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "and with which solution you come up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 250.92,
          "en": "But you should identify the state that needs to be managed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.92,
          "end": 254.61,
          "en": "and you should add the code for managing that state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.61,
          "end": 257.34,
          "en": "You should, for example, make sure that all the user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 257.34,
          "end": 259.98,
          "en": "is picked up and used and available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.98,
          "end": 261.69,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.69,
          "end": 263.13,
          "en": "And you should of course make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.13,
          "end": 265.59,
          "en": "that all this investment data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.59,
          "end": 267.78,
          "en": "that's being derived here is also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.78,
          "end": 271.56,
          "en": "managed as states somehow because it's that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.56,
          "end": 274.11,
          "en": "that then later needs to be output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.11,
          "end": 276.21,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 278.88,
          "en": "Now, last but not least, you should of course then also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.88,
          "end": 282.87,
          "en": "use that state to output some data on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.87,
          "end": 286.29,
          "en": "to output the results of this investment calculation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 286.29,
          "end": 287.97,
          "en": "to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 287.97,
          "end": 291.45,
          "en": "For that, you should make sure that this table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.45,
          "end": 293.25,
          "en": "which you have at the bottom here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.25,
          "end": 298.05,
          "en": "is output conditionally only if data is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 298.05,
          "end": 300,
          "en": "If no data is available yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 300,
          "end": 303,
          "en": "because no calculation has been performed yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303,
          "end": 305.973,
          "en": "you should output some fallback text instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 307.02,
          "end": 309.42,
          "en": "And you also should make sure that of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.42,
          "end": 312.84,
          "en": "you output all these rows of that table dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.84,
          "end": 316.5,
          "en": "One row per year because of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.5,
          "end": 320.61,
          "en": "we are deriving investment data for multiple years here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 320.61,
          "end": 324.3,
          "en": "Last but not least there is a little bonus task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.3,
          "end": 327.66,
          "en": "because you can definitely also dive into styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.66,
          "end": 332.43,
          "en": "and either use styled components or anything like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 332.43,
          "end": 336.81,
          "en": "or maybe at least split up this index CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 336.81,
          "end": 339.9,
          "en": "into multiple module CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 339.9,
          "end": 344.1,
          "en": "that belong to the individual components that are being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 344.1,
          "end": 345.9,
          "en": "in the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.9,
          "end": 349.08,
          "en": "That is something you also might wanna consider doing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 349.08,
          "end": 351.48,
          "en": "And of course, also feel free to adjust",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 351.48,
          "end": 353.34000000000003,
          "en": "and tweak these stylings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 353.34000000000003,
          "end": 356.90999999999997,
          "en": "so that they meet your personal preferences.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 356.90999999999997,
          "end": 359.90999999999997,
          "en": "But that being said, this is your starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 359.90999999999997,
          "end": 363.18,
          "en": "These are your tasks in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
